WEBVTT

00:25.880 --> 00:27.560
Look at how scared you are.

00:33.360 --> 00:34.360
Hello,

00:34.440 --> 00:35.520
I am Chen Maidong's mom.

00:40.120 --> 00:41.320
Hello, ma'am.

00:42.160 --> 00:43.280
I am Zhuang Jie,

00:43.360 --> 00:46.040
Chen Maidong's high school classmate.

00:48.480 --> 00:49.760
I will leave you be.

00:49.840 --> 00:51.560
Something came up. I need to go.

00:52.320 --> 00:53.200
It's fine, ma'am.

00:53.280 --> 00:54.480
You can talk.

00:54.560 --> 00:56.320
I'm not here for something important.

01:00.800 --> 01:01.760
It's fine.

01:01.840 --> 01:03.000
I was leaving anyway.

01:03.080 --> 01:04.120
Take care.

01:10.040 --> 01:11.400
Are you not seeing her off?

01:19.600 --> 01:20.520
Come on in.

01:21.840 --> 01:22.760
It's chilly.

02:48.160 --> 02:52.640
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

02:59.520 --> 03:00.640
It's cold in the living room.

03:00.720 --> 03:01.960
Do you want to go to my room?

03:02.920 --> 03:05.960
Being with you alone in your room
isn't appropriate.

03:07.600 --> 03:08.800
Seriously?

03:10.280 --> 03:12.280
Fine, forget it.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.080
Did your mom

03:17.160 --> 03:18.560
come all the way here to see you?

03:19.600 --> 03:20.720
How can that be possible?

03:21.440 --> 03:22.280
Just dropping by.

03:22.920 --> 03:23.840
Not that it matters.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.960
It's just some family stuff.

03:27.240 --> 03:28.200
She could've said it

03:28.280 --> 03:29.760
over a quick phone call.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.400
Count your blessings.

03:33.360 --> 03:34.520
Cherish your parents.

03:35.600 --> 03:36.480
Look at me.

03:36.560 --> 03:37.880
When I miss my two dads,

03:37.960 --> 03:39.760
I can only make a wish before going to bed

03:39.840 --> 03:41.320
and hope they come into my dreams.

03:43.960 --> 03:45.120
I have complicated feelings

03:47.800 --> 03:48.680
about them.

03:50.920 --> 03:52.200
You are traumatized.

03:53.800 --> 03:55.240
Because of their breakup,

03:55.320 --> 03:56.960
you have no trust in relationships

03:57.040 --> 03:58.480
and feel insecure.

04:00.160 --> 04:01.200
Like you know a lot.

04:07.440 --> 04:09.480
In the early years after the car accident,

04:09.560 --> 04:10.440
I couldn't get over

04:10.520 --> 04:11.840
my rage and frustration.

04:11.920 --> 04:13.840
So I read psychology books every day,

04:14.400 --> 04:18.040
and I found Adler's theory
to be the most practical.

04:18.600 --> 04:21.360
Never find excuses for your failure,

04:21.920 --> 04:24.320
like your original family
and traumatic childhood.

04:24.400 --> 04:26.760
They're only for blaming
all those awful people out there,

04:26.840 --> 04:28.120
self-pitying, or the like.

04:28.200 --> 04:29.440
But in fact,

04:29.520 --> 04:30.840
people come up with these claims

04:30.920 --> 04:32.720
to make themselves feel special.

04:35.960 --> 04:37.520
If you say this out there,

04:38.000 --> 04:38.960
you will get beaten up.

04:39.960 --> 04:41.320
Except for you,

04:41.400 --> 04:42.840
no one would beat a disabled person.

04:45.520 --> 04:46.480
Look at you.

04:48.400 --> 04:50.080
You are so mean.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.440
Hasn't anyone punched you before?

04:52.320 --> 04:53.600
Because I'm only mean to you.

04:58.920 --> 05:03.000
When I decided to follow Adler,

05:03.080 --> 05:04.560
I watched the Paralympics repeatedly

05:04.640 --> 05:06.480
and read Helen Keller.

05:07.240 --> 05:08.160
Finally,

05:08.240 --> 05:09.720
I overcame those bitter days

05:10.280 --> 05:11.400
and returned to school.

05:12.280 --> 05:13.280
Then I met you.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.840
The first one to show no empathy
to a disabled person.

05:17.480 --> 05:19.840
You even said a crutch could be a weapon.

05:22.360 --> 05:24.280
I wouldn't compare myself
with these great people.

05:25.240 --> 05:26.360
Why not?

05:26.440 --> 05:28.040
At least you have been through a lot.

05:30.080 --> 05:32.760
That's why I always thought
you had a clear head.

05:32.840 --> 05:34.240
But you're still traumatized

05:34.320 --> 05:35.880
by your parents' situation.

05:38.960 --> 05:40.600
I haven't brought myself round
to that yet.

05:41.200 --> 05:42.240
Chen Maidong,

05:43.960 --> 05:45.600
only babies use vulnerability as a weapon

05:45.680 --> 05:47.040
to manipulate grown-ups.

05:48.520 --> 05:50.120
Those who surround themselves

05:50.200 --> 05:51.920
with misfortune and trauma

05:52.520 --> 05:54.440
and subconsciously demand empathy

05:55.160 --> 05:56.200
are big babies.

05:58.720 --> 06:00.480
Growing up means maturity in spirit,

06:01.000 --> 06:02.240
not in age.

06:02.320 --> 06:04.280
I never wanted
to burden anyone with my life.

06:06.160 --> 06:08.160
I just want
to live a life like this until the end.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.200
But you give out the signals

06:13.280 --> 06:14.680
that you need someone to love you.

06:18.280 --> 06:19.160
Nonsense.

06:19.920 --> 06:20.800
I mean it.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.880
Being aloof

06:23.960 --> 06:25.200
can also be charming.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.720
Is this what hooked you in?

06:31.600 --> 06:33.760
There is more that attracts me.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.960
Do you like me that much?

06:44.160 --> 06:45.320
Very much so.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.400
Chen Maidong,

07:12.920 --> 07:14.960
we have to stop being kids.

07:16.400 --> 07:17.440
When we were kids,

07:17.920 --> 07:20.640
we needed our parents' love to carry on.

07:21.440 --> 07:23.400
That's how we survived.

07:23.480 --> 07:25.120
But being loved

07:26.120 --> 07:27.960
isn't a natural thing in the first place.

07:29.080 --> 07:31.800
We are not the center of the world.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.360
How should we live, then?

07:38.840 --> 07:39.960
Go and love.

07:52.800 --> 07:54.000
Love others

07:55.440 --> 07:56.920
instead of waiting to be loved.

07:59.960 --> 08:01.560
This is the only way

08:01.640 --> 08:03.040
for a child to become an adult.

08:06.600 --> 08:08.560
The first time I felt happiness was

08:10.600 --> 08:13.320
when I knew I had the ability
to love my family.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.360
Even though I'm disabled,

08:16.960 --> 08:18.160
it can't stop me

08:18.240 --> 08:19.440
from doing anything for them.

08:25.000 --> 08:25.840
So,

08:26.640 --> 08:29.040
only you can decide how you live.

08:30.360 --> 08:31.840
Go after what you want.

08:32.919 --> 08:34.320
Don't regret even if you fall short.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.240
Being in your profession,

08:37.320 --> 08:39.480
have you not realized
that life is too short?

09:04.560 --> 09:07.000
If it bothers you

09:07.080 --> 09:08.880
that I always flirt with you,

09:08.960 --> 09:10.240
I can change.

09:15.720 --> 09:17.880
But sooner or later,
you have to learn to love someone.

09:21.400 --> 09:22.400
As long as you are happy,

09:23.200 --> 09:24.760
I will be happy for you.

09:30.760 --> 09:31.680
Bye.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.600
I have to run an errand for Madam Wu.

09:35.360 --> 09:37.840
Think deeply about my gospel.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.640
Nonsense.

09:48.800 --> 09:49.840
That doesn't make sense.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.480
The receptionist says I have a parcel.

10:20.560 --> 10:21.400
Is it you?

10:24.280 --> 10:25.840
I brought you the medicinal patches.

10:28.720 --> 10:29.560
All right.

10:29.640 --> 10:30.520
The amount is correct.

10:31.120 --> 10:32.680
I thought it would be a deliveryman.

10:32.760 --> 10:33.880
I'm that deliveryman.

10:35.000 --> 10:36.440
-How much is it?
-There is no need.

10:36.520 --> 10:37.800
You can treat me to a meal.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.640
Is this compulsory?

10:41.160 --> 10:42.120
No, it's not.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.320
I would rather pay you. Here.

10:45.760 --> 10:48.160
It's 320 yuan. I'll round it down to 300.

10:48.240 --> 10:49.360
No, I will give you 350 yuan,

10:49.440 --> 10:50.440
including a delivery fee.

11:03.160 --> 11:05.000
Don't you have a QR code for payment?

11:05.800 --> 11:07.160
Exchanging contacts

11:07.240 --> 11:08.600
is normal social etiquette, right?

11:09.440 --> 11:11.040
-Hi, Cici.
-Hi.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.120
Cici?

11:18.840 --> 11:19.760
Cici.

11:24.000 --> 11:24.960
Xixia.

11:28.840 --> 11:29.680
I'm paying.

11:29.760 --> 11:30.600
Let's dine together

11:30.680 --> 11:32.120
before I go back to France.

11:33.120 --> 11:34.040
No.

11:35.200 --> 11:36.120
I have plans.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.160
Hello, I'm Ji Tong,

11:41.240 --> 11:42.760
Wang Xixia's superior.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.640
Hello, I'm Cui Ge,

11:46.720 --> 11:48.520
Wang Xixia's blind date.

11:54.200 --> 11:55.960
The lunch break is short.

11:56.040 --> 11:57.680
Let's eat together. It's more fun.

11:59.840 --> 12:01.640
No, it's not convenient.

12:01.720 --> 12:02.760
Let's go our separate ways.

12:03.560 --> 12:04.440
Are we really going?

12:05.000 --> 12:06.360
I left my glasses there.

12:44.720 --> 12:46.360
LIN BAOBAO VETERINARY CLINIC

13:04.000 --> 13:05.880
Ms. Lin, I'm Zhuang Jie.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.160
Is it Jie?

13:07.240 --> 13:08.360
I'm coming in.

13:08.440 --> 13:09.360
Ms. Lin.

13:12.240 --> 13:13.680
-Ms. Lin.
-Hello.

13:13.760 --> 13:15.480
You have a beautiful house.

13:16.000 --> 13:17.400
Ms. Lin, what are you doing?

13:17.480 --> 13:20.360
Come. I can do this for you.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.680
-Should I put it here?
-It's fine. I can manage.

13:26.520 --> 13:27.480
It's beautiful.

13:30.240 --> 13:32.040
Finally, someone gets it.

13:32.560 --> 13:34.880
Mrs. Chen always says

13:34.960 --> 13:36.000
he's dressed indecently.

13:36.480 --> 13:38.680
She always wants me to remove it.

13:44.280 --> 13:45.520
What a sweet couple.

13:46.160 --> 13:48.400
This was me when I was young.

13:49.320 --> 13:50.320
You looked pretty.

13:51.120 --> 13:53.120
Is the man beside you your husband?

13:55.720 --> 13:57.000
He was my boyfriend.

13:57.080 --> 13:58.680
I'm not married.

14:00.640 --> 14:03.160
He died at the age of 32.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.200
I'm sorry, Ms. Lin.

14:06.720 --> 14:08.120
It has been years.

14:08.960 --> 14:10.160
We were in love,

14:10.240 --> 14:11.520
so there are no regrets.

14:12.360 --> 14:14.800
He died in his prime.

14:14.880 --> 14:16.160
He has been in my heart

14:16.240 --> 14:17.880
for my whole life already.

14:18.520 --> 14:20.240
That's fair for both of us.

14:20.320 --> 14:21.400
That's nice.

14:23.760 --> 14:25.160
That's right, Ms. Lin.

14:26.680 --> 14:28.600
Madam Wu asked me to pass this on to you.

14:29.120 --> 14:30.560
I never take money.

14:30.640 --> 14:32.960
Besides, I didn't help her much.

14:33.040 --> 14:34.680
We only chatted.

14:34.760 --> 14:35.640
Ms. Lin.

14:36.280 --> 14:37.440
Jie, have a seat.

14:37.520 --> 14:38.440
I'll make you some tea.

14:38.520 --> 14:39.800
Sure. Thank you.

14:48.320 --> 14:50.080
There is a cat.

14:59.560 --> 15:04.000
LIN JINGRU, FEMALE, 72 YEARS OLD,
DEPARTMENT: ONCOLOGY

15:31.840 --> 15:32.920
Just make do with this.

15:34.920 --> 15:35.920
It's pretty good.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.720
It's great that I can help you

15:37.800 --> 15:39.360
avoid someone you loathe even more.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.760
You're just the lesser evil.

15:40.840 --> 15:41.920
What are you proud of?

15:42.000 --> 15:44.600
I'm satisfied
as long as I'm not the worst.

15:45.360 --> 15:48.280
Is it because physicians are always
the ones doing the diagnosing?

15:48.360 --> 15:49.800
Your brains are wired differently.

15:51.040 --> 15:52.680
It has nothing to do with my profession.

15:52.760 --> 15:55.680
I'm just rather blunt

15:55.760 --> 15:56.920
and not very tactful.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.280
I haven't touched them.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.320
They are clean.

16:22.400 --> 16:23.920
I don't like vegetables.

16:24.560 --> 16:25.440
Then why did you…

16:25.520 --> 16:26.720
I'm hungry,

16:26.800 --> 16:28.600
so I ate them first.

16:30.560 --> 16:32.280
Well, I totally screwed up.

16:37.680 --> 16:38.680
Gosh, you.

16:45.160 --> 16:46.000
Meat.

16:48.760 --> 16:49.760
Meat.

16:50.680 --> 16:51.680
It's meat.

16:52.880 --> 16:54.160
Gosh, you.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.560
You are in your thirties.

16:55.640 --> 16:57.080
How can you be so awkward?

16:57.160 --> 16:58.760
Like I said,

16:58.840 --> 17:01.360
I don't have much experience with women.

17:01.440 --> 17:02.840
I've only been with my ex-wife.

17:03.800 --> 17:05.079
So, for your convenience,

17:05.160 --> 17:06.760
you're following the same old template.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.440
Regarding this,

17:11.480 --> 17:12.599
I have reflected on it.

17:12.680 --> 17:14.560
Previously, I didn't make myself clear.

17:14.640 --> 17:15.839
I don't mean

17:15.920 --> 17:17.839
to find an exact person like her.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.839
I just assumed

17:19.920 --> 17:22.640
I could replicate the happy life
I had before.

17:22.720 --> 17:23.880
My ex-wife and I

17:23.960 --> 17:25.280
got along quite well,

17:25.359 --> 17:26.680
and we respected each other.

17:26.760 --> 17:28.720
Even now, I'm very grateful to her

17:28.800 --> 17:30.920
for giving me
those precious relationship experiences.

17:31.840 --> 17:34.080
Maybe my marriage was too smooth,

17:34.680 --> 17:37.480
so I don't have any dating skills now.

17:39.400 --> 17:41.320
It has been four years since she passed.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.480
You are the first woman

17:45.560 --> 17:47.000
who made my heart flutter.

17:49.120 --> 17:50.480
Because I look like her.

17:50.560 --> 17:52.480
I thought so when I first saw you.

17:52.560 --> 17:54.280
Can you say something new?

17:56.160 --> 17:57.320
But now I think

17:58.360 --> 17:59.680
you two are nothing alike.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.920
I shouldn't have made you feel

18:04.000 --> 18:05.600
that I was comparing you to her.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.360
I'm sorry.

18:12.680 --> 18:15.000
A widower has a harder time
finding a new partner

18:15.080 --> 18:16.320
than a divorcée.

18:16.400 --> 18:17.240
Exactly.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.560
That's why I was thrilled when I met you.

18:19.640 --> 18:22.440
The way you attack me mentally

18:22.520 --> 18:25.320
or verbally insult me

18:25.400 --> 18:27.560
is exciting and novel to me.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.200
You are quite optimistic.

18:30.800 --> 18:32.200
Well, I will be honest with you.

18:32.280 --> 18:33.160
Sure.

18:35.200 --> 18:36.720
We are worlds apart.

18:37.400 --> 18:39.240
I find it hard
to hold a conversation with you.

18:40.240 --> 18:43.320
But I think we are deeply fated.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.560
Are you finished? Let's go.

18:52.640 --> 18:53.720
Wait, I haven't started yet.

18:53.800 --> 18:54.960
I was giving you my food.

18:55.040 --> 18:55.920
I haven't eaten yet.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.680
Fine, go on.

18:57.760 --> 18:59.360
-Excuse me.
-No.

18:59.440 --> 19:00.640
-Xixia.
-I will pay.

19:01.400 --> 19:02.760
I can accept a lady paying.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.760
I have something else to tell you.

19:07.760 --> 19:09.520
From my observation,

19:09.600 --> 19:11.000
I think

19:11.960 --> 19:13.960
you are someone who tends

19:14.040 --> 19:15.000
to have mood swings.

19:15.880 --> 19:17.280
So I suggest…

19:19.760 --> 19:20.800
Come closer.

19:21.440 --> 19:22.520
No, I'm serious.

19:22.600 --> 19:23.480
Come closer.

19:24.560 --> 19:26.320
We're in public.
I can't do anything to you.

19:31.400 --> 19:32.480
I suggest

19:33.240 --> 19:35.120
that the next time you have mood swings,

19:35.200 --> 19:36.680
you can massage the Baihui acupoint.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.600
Massage here.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.440
Feeling better, right?

19:44.120 --> 19:45.320
Ridiculous.

19:46.000 --> 19:47.160
If you suffer from agitation,

19:47.240 --> 19:48.760
the Laogong acupoint is in your palm,

19:48.840 --> 19:49.680
You can massage that.

19:50.640 --> 19:51.720
Right here, in the palm.

19:54.120 --> 19:56.160
If you can't find it, text me.

19:58.360 --> 19:59.520
You all can massage this point

19:59.600 --> 20:01.120
if you stay up late.

20:12.880 --> 20:13.840
So,

20:14.760 --> 20:16.840
only you can decide how you live.

20:17.560 --> 20:19.080
Go after what you want.

20:19.160 --> 20:20.880
Don't regret even if you fall short.

20:20.960 --> 20:22.000
Being in your profession,

20:22.080 --> 20:24.480
have you not realized
that life is too short?

20:34.280 --> 20:35.280
Madam Wu.

20:35.360 --> 20:36.320
Maidong,

20:36.400 --> 20:37.760
what are you doing here?

20:37.840 --> 20:38.680
I'm waiting for you.

20:42.760 --> 20:44.080
I have a favor to ask of you.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.760
Me?

21:09.680 --> 21:10.560
Liao Tao.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.400
You are at home.

21:13.960 --> 21:15.760
I bought you
a basket of organic vegetables.

21:15.840 --> 21:16.680
Come on in.

21:16.760 --> 21:17.880
It's fine. You can continue.

21:17.960 --> 21:18.960
Hello, Madam Wu.

21:19.040 --> 21:20.280
Jie, you are home.

21:20.360 --> 21:22.280
I'm here to chat with your mom.

21:22.360 --> 21:23.480
What a refined girl.

21:24.000 --> 21:25.000
She is reading.

21:25.080 --> 21:26.320
Unlike my daughter.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.560
She's always on her phone
and lazes around.

21:29.640 --> 21:30.760
What are you busy with?

21:30.840 --> 21:32.880
I'm chatting with a buyer.

21:32.960 --> 21:34.160
Give me a moment.

21:34.240 --> 21:36.280
Isn't there
a professional customer service?

21:36.360 --> 21:38.240
You are typing so slowly.

21:38.320 --> 21:39.680
Do you expect the customer to wait?

21:40.160 --> 21:42.040
I prefer to do things myself

21:42.120 --> 21:42.960
if I can.

21:43.040 --> 21:44.640
Otherwise, it's easy to get shortchanged.

21:45.280 --> 21:47.600
I know both you and your daughter
will achieve great things.

21:47.680 --> 21:48.520
Right?

21:49.280 --> 21:50.360
I can't.

21:50.440 --> 21:52.360
Typing a few words tires me out.

21:52.440 --> 21:53.640
Zhuang Jie is better than me.

21:53.720 --> 21:55.000
Rightfully so.

21:55.080 --> 21:57.200
Jie is capable.

21:57.280 --> 21:59.440
She can do just well wherever she goes.

22:01.080 --> 22:03.120
Is she really planning

22:03.200 --> 22:05.960
to settle down in Shanghai?

22:08.160 --> 22:09.400
Who knows?

22:10.040 --> 22:10.880
She aims high

22:10.960 --> 22:13.160
and is determined to stay there.

22:13.240 --> 22:14.360
I can't do anything about it.

22:15.200 --> 22:16.800
Won't she consider coming back?

22:18.160 --> 22:21.680
Nowadays, many young people
start businesses back in their hometown

22:21.760 --> 22:23.440
as they are familiar
with the people there.

22:23.520 --> 22:25.720
Besides, they can get support, right?

22:25.800 --> 22:28.080
We have been in this town
for our entire lives

22:28.160 --> 22:29.640
and haven't seen much of the world,

22:29.720 --> 22:31.120
which we think is fine.

22:31.200 --> 22:33.920
But they've seen the big world out there.

22:34.000 --> 22:35.640
Do you think
they are willing to come back?

22:39.000 --> 22:40.360
To be honest,

22:40.440 --> 22:42.200
I would like to introduce a man to her.

22:43.760 --> 22:45.440
If Jie would come back,

22:45.520 --> 22:47.240
I'm thinking of setting her up with him.

22:48.200 --> 22:49.080
Her?

22:49.760 --> 22:52.000
I doubt she would settle down

22:52.080 --> 22:53.120
with a townsman here.

22:53.200 --> 22:55.080
Can you talk about me when I'm not here?

22:56.160 --> 22:57.560
Even if we talk in heaven,

22:57.640 --> 22:59.320
would you want to marry a man here?

23:01.360 --> 23:02.280
See?

23:03.440 --> 23:05.160
No one can decide for her.

23:05.840 --> 23:06.760
She either ignores you

23:06.840 --> 23:08.520
or uses words against you.

23:11.040 --> 23:14.400
Frankly, I also think this is a long shot.

23:14.480 --> 23:16.960
But since I have promised him,

23:17.040 --> 23:19.080
I have to give it a go, right?

23:19.760 --> 23:21.240
As moms, we worry for nothing.

23:21.320 --> 23:23.440
Let's just mind our own business.

23:23.520 --> 23:26.320
You have grown the vegetables so well.

23:26.400 --> 23:27.800
Listen, this cucumber

23:27.880 --> 23:29.280
is very sweet when eaten raw.

23:34.760 --> 23:35.680
These vegetables

23:36.400 --> 23:37.360
are so fresh.

23:49.960 --> 23:50.920
Master,

23:51.440 --> 23:53.680
I will go through the steps again.

24:04.680 --> 24:05.800
Master.

24:05.880 --> 24:06.920
I…

24:07.000 --> 24:09.040
I'm going to cleanse your face first.

24:11.920 --> 24:13.920
Do you expect the deceased to teach you?

24:14.000 --> 24:15.400
No. I'm sorry, Master.

24:15.480 --> 24:16.760
Please don't suddenly

24:16.840 --> 24:18.320
open your eyes again.

24:36.520 --> 24:38.200
If we had repeat customers,

24:38.760 --> 24:40.080
your face-washing skills

24:40.160 --> 24:41.400
would surely get a bad review.

25:08.760 --> 25:09.800
Hi, Madam Wu.

25:11.400 --> 25:12.320
I'm free.

25:13.120 --> 25:14.840
I'll be in the reception room
in 30 seconds.

25:14.920 --> 25:15.800
All right.

25:17.760 --> 25:19.240
Go over the rest of the steps again.

25:19.320 --> 25:20.160
We'll continue later.

25:20.240 --> 25:21.280
All right.

25:27.400 --> 25:28.240
Maidong.

25:31.200 --> 25:32.280
Well…

25:34.400 --> 25:36.120
That's the result.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.760
Jie and her mom

25:38.840 --> 25:40.560
have thought it through.

25:41.680 --> 25:43.840
They won't look for men in our town.

25:50.560 --> 25:51.600
All right.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.640
It's all right.

25:52.720 --> 25:55.480
You will definitely
find the right person for you. Believe me.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.640
When I go back later,

25:56.720 --> 25:59.080
I'll focus on nothing else
but going through the names again.

25:59.160 --> 26:01.640
If there's someone good,
I will ask your grandma to take a look.

26:01.720 --> 26:03.160
You can meet them when you have time.

26:04.360 --> 26:05.600
Thank you, Madam Wu.

26:05.680 --> 26:06.760
Sorry for the trouble.

26:07.360 --> 26:08.240
I'll go now.

26:10.560 --> 26:11.440
Maidong.

26:15.920 --> 26:16.880
Let it go.

26:18.400 --> 26:20.000
Don't let it bother you.

26:36.120 --> 26:36.960
Get up there.

26:38.920 --> 26:39.960
I will show you once.

26:42.520 --> 26:43.800
It's not a good idea, Master.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.920
I need more practice.

26:45.000 --> 26:45.880
Lie down.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.960
Master, is something wrong?

26:56.040 --> 26:56.960
Close your eyes.

27:02.280 --> 27:03.480
Master,

27:03.560 --> 27:04.960
I don't feel safe.

27:05.040 --> 27:07.400
Remember that I'm alive.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.480
-I--
-Cut your crap.

27:09.880 --> 27:10.800
Quiet.

27:36.840 --> 27:38.000
I'm almost 30.

27:38.680 --> 27:40.680
I'm not some young girl
obsessed with love.

27:46.000 --> 27:49.080
Everyone has to face reality.

27:49.680 --> 27:51.360
People can't survive

27:51.440 --> 27:53.160
on romantic gestures

27:54.040 --> 27:55.240
and emotional impulses.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.320
Chen Maidong,

27:58.800 --> 27:59.640
I like you.

28:00.800 --> 28:01.720
I'm serious.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.680
But I love Shanghai more.

28:06.920 --> 28:07.760
This is the reality

28:07.840 --> 28:09.040
between you and me.

28:20.520 --> 28:21.880
I was rude to you earlier.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.600
Call the other colleagues.

28:25.600 --> 28:26.840
Dinner is on me tonight.

29:03.280 --> 29:04.160
Chen Maidong,

29:05.240 --> 29:06.520
I found out a secret.

29:07.600 --> 29:09.320
I don't know who I should tell.

29:09.400 --> 29:10.640
I'm confused.

29:10.720 --> 29:12.720
Because this concerns someone's privacy--

29:12.800 --> 29:13.640
Jie, are you not up?

29:13.720 --> 29:14.560
Close the door.

29:20.920 --> 29:22.920
You will understand after hearing it.

29:23.520 --> 29:25.160
It may affect some people,

29:25.680 --> 29:27.120
especially your grandma.

29:28.040 --> 29:29.400
I'm quite worried.

29:29.480 --> 29:30.520
I'm struggling over

29:30.600 --> 29:31.960
whether I should tell you.

29:32.040 --> 29:33.160
Are you still not up yet?

29:33.240 --> 29:34.160
Right away.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.640
Chen Maidong.

29:44.800 --> 29:45.960
Where was I?

29:46.040 --> 29:47.200
Jie, hurry and get up!

29:48.160 --> 29:49.080
You are lazy.

30:06.280 --> 30:10.000
LIN BAOBAO VETERINARY CLINIC

30:20.800 --> 30:23.280
Chen Maidong, are you busy today?

30:23.960 --> 30:25.120
I'm so distracted.

30:25.200 --> 30:27.040
There is something
I must talk to you about.

30:27.120 --> 30:28.200
What time are you off work?

30:49.080 --> 30:50.960
Mrs. Chen, I brought you some fruit.

30:51.040 --> 30:52.120
Try it.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.120
If you like them,

30:53.200 --> 30:54.280
I will bring more next time.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.480
I came here

30:56.560 --> 30:58.800
to talk about me and Chen Maidong.

31:00.720 --> 31:02.400
I believe Madam Wu has told you about it.

31:03.160 --> 31:04.040
Mrs. Chen.

31:04.680 --> 31:05.560
Jie.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.880
Mrs. Chen, do you have a guest?

31:09.960 --> 31:11.000
I won't disturb you.

31:11.080 --> 31:13.280
No. Jie, is something the matter?

31:14.000 --> 31:15.680
Nothing. Don't let me keep you.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.120
Jie!

31:25.120 --> 31:25.960
Jie.

31:26.760 --> 31:27.600
Wait up.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.680
Mrs. Chen, go inside.

31:29.760 --> 31:30.920
Don't ignore your guest.

31:31.760 --> 31:33.200
Madam Wu introduced her.

31:33.280 --> 31:34.960
She showed up all of a sudden.

31:35.640 --> 31:37.440
I was completely caught off guard.

31:37.920 --> 31:39.000
Madam Wu said

31:39.080 --> 31:40.920
she wanted to compensate Chen Maidong.

31:41.000 --> 31:42.440
I don't have the faintest idea

31:42.520 --> 31:43.640
what that is all about.

31:44.520 --> 31:45.560
To be honest,

31:45.640 --> 31:47.360
I would like to introduce a man to her.

31:49.160 --> 31:50.880
If Jie would come back here,

31:50.960 --> 31:53.040
I'm thinking of setting her up with him.

31:53.680 --> 31:54.680
Her?

31:55.160 --> 31:56.800
I doubt she would settle down

31:56.880 --> 31:59.000
with a townsman here.

31:59.080 --> 32:00.560
But the girl is here,

32:01.200 --> 32:02.360
so I have to talk to her.

32:02.440 --> 32:05.400
Mrs. Chen, it's all right. Just go ahead.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.920
I'm fine with it.

32:07.960 --> 32:09.080
Hurry and go inside.

32:09.160 --> 32:10.400
Don't give her the wrong idea.

32:10.480 --> 32:11.800
You…

32:11.880 --> 32:14.000
By the way, Maidong called and said

32:14.080 --> 32:15.880
he's going to the movies with colleagues.

32:15.960 --> 32:17.040
Go and find him there.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.480
All right.

32:32.600 --> 32:34.920
I don't think this sequel is bad.

32:35.000 --> 32:36.520
Rey is awesome.

32:36.600 --> 32:38.120
Although she was born on the dark side,

32:38.200 --> 32:39.880
she refused to be Palpatine's queen.

32:39.960 --> 32:41.600
She deserves to be a Jedi.

32:42.960 --> 32:45.440
When she held Luke and Reia's lightsabers,

32:45.520 --> 32:47.040
I almost burst into tears!

32:47.120 --> 32:48.160
Maidong,

32:48.240 --> 32:49.800
do you like films like this?

32:49.880 --> 32:51.400
It's quite good. It's an exciting film.

32:51.920 --> 32:53.440
Next time, I will buy the tickets.

32:53.520 --> 32:54.400
Let's watch.

32:55.160 --> 32:56.680
You should invite Feng Xilun.

32:56.760 --> 32:58.480
He knows more about movies.

33:03.920 --> 33:05.360
Master, go on. We are leaving.

33:05.440 --> 33:06.360
Hurry and go.

33:19.920 --> 33:20.920
Are you here for me?

33:23.720 --> 33:25.080
You are busy, Chen Maidong.

33:27.280 --> 33:29.000
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

33:29.560 --> 33:30.640
It's on Do Not Disturb.

33:30.720 --> 33:31.640
Why?

33:32.160 --> 33:33.440
Why do you think?

33:33.520 --> 33:34.520
I don't know.

33:36.840 --> 33:37.800
Stop playing games.

33:38.640 --> 33:39.520
It's not fun.

33:40.920 --> 33:41.760
Zhuang Jie,

33:42.720 --> 33:44.400
I'm just a simple townsman

33:45.240 --> 33:46.440
on the straight and narrow.

33:47.040 --> 33:48.400
I don't belong to your kind.

33:50.600 --> 33:52.120
Let's go our separate ways from now on.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.560
Fine.

33:57.320 --> 33:59.280
If I ever care
about you again, I'm a fool.

34:00.560 --> 34:01.920
Have you ever cared about anyone?

34:03.800 --> 34:06.120
Sometimes, I doubt if you have a heart.

34:08.400 --> 34:09.960
Chen Maidong, you are unreasonable.

34:10.760 --> 34:11.719
Am I unreasonable?

34:12.760 --> 34:15.120
You say one thing and do another.
Is that reasonable?

34:15.960 --> 34:16.840
For crying out loud.

34:16.920 --> 34:19.440
Have I been playing some love game
with you? Is it fun?

34:21.280 --> 34:22.679
Chen Maidong, listen up.

34:23.400 --> 34:25.719
I might have a lot of problems,
but I always say what I mean.

34:26.600 --> 34:28.040
You sent Madam Wu as a matchmaker.

34:28.120 --> 34:30.120
Did you even tell me in advance?

34:31.159 --> 34:33.159
Madam Wu didn't make it clear.
My mom dissuaded her.

34:33.239 --> 34:34.280
So you blame me?

34:34.800 --> 34:36.960
You started the matchmaking thing,
but I had no idea.

34:37.040 --> 34:38.400
You're the one playing games.

34:38.480 --> 34:40.760
Now that things are messed up,
you take it out on me.

34:40.840 --> 34:42.000
I'm so embarrassed for you.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.840
When it comes to our personalities,

34:46.920 --> 34:48.239
I'm much more frank than you are.

34:48.320 --> 34:49.960
You are a difficult man. Too difficult.

35:57.600 --> 35:58.520
Get lost.

36:09.040 --> 36:10.200
It's my fault.

36:10.280 --> 36:12.160
I was inconsiderate and snapped at you.

36:12.760 --> 36:14.280
I won't do it again, all right?

36:14.360 --> 36:15.400
Don't touch me.

36:17.560 --> 36:19.080
Didn't you tell me to make a move

36:19.160 --> 36:20.440
rather than sit and wait?

36:21.640 --> 36:22.920
I took your words too seriously

36:23.000 --> 36:24.000
and did something stupid.

36:24.560 --> 36:25.880
Are you blaming me?

36:27.560 --> 36:28.560
Let's not argue anymore.

36:29.400 --> 36:30.480
Anyway, I only want you.

36:31.320 --> 36:32.520
You must take responsibility.

36:37.040 --> 36:38.560
-Enough.
-What are you doing?

36:39.600 --> 36:40.480
Don't be angry.

36:43.760 --> 36:44.680
It's my fault.

36:51.120 --> 36:52.200
Are you kidnapping me?

36:52.280 --> 36:54.520
Yes. You can call the police.

36:56.280 --> 36:57.920
Should I call the police
or hold you tight?

37:00.480 --> 37:01.600
Put me down.

37:27.000 --> 37:28.040
Where are you going?

37:28.720 --> 37:30.040
To kiss you.

38:14.240 --> 38:15.120
Look.

38:15.200 --> 38:16.760
The art exhibition

38:16.840 --> 38:18.200
is quite popular in our town.

38:19.840 --> 38:21.480
These young people have done a great job.

38:21.560 --> 38:24.120
They turned this decrepit area
into a decent place.

38:28.640 --> 38:30.200
Don't you think lanterns over there

38:30.280 --> 38:31.560
look like a spittoon?

38:32.280 --> 38:33.320
Keep your voice down.

38:33.400 --> 38:34.760
We might get kicked out

38:34.840 --> 38:36.280
if the artist hears us.

38:36.360 --> 38:37.640
All right, I will stop.

38:37.720 --> 38:38.920
Now I'm already fine with it.

38:39.600 --> 38:42.360
If my daughter and son-in-law want
to be DINKs, I'll let them be.

38:42.440 --> 38:44.800
As long as they don't mess up their lives

38:44.880 --> 38:45.920
and are happy,

38:46.000 --> 38:47.040
I couldn't ask for more.

38:48.120 --> 38:49.000
Put the cigarette out.

38:49.480 --> 38:50.600
How could you smoke here?

38:50.680 --> 38:52.600
Didn't you see the no-smoking sign?

38:52.680 --> 38:53.600
Do it outside!

38:54.360 --> 38:55.600
Such an addict.

38:59.880 --> 39:00.840
All I wish is

39:01.480 --> 39:03.640
that my child has a partner beside her

39:03.720 --> 39:04.600
when she is old.

39:04.680 --> 39:05.800
I won't ask for more.

39:05.880 --> 39:06.960
There you go.

39:07.040 --> 39:09.040
We are getting up in years.

39:09.120 --> 39:11.120
We can't worry ourselves
about things so far ahead.

39:16.160 --> 39:18.280
What do they think
they are doing in public?

39:18.360 --> 39:20.360
Don't intervene
in other people's children.

39:21.000 --> 39:22.000
Enough.

39:22.080 --> 39:23.000
This is unbelievable.

39:23.520 --> 39:24.880
Look at the romantic ambiance here.

39:24.960 --> 39:26.200
Just let them be.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.360
I didn't expect Nanping

39:34.440 --> 39:35.880
to have an art exhibition like this.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.200
It's so beautiful.

39:37.280 --> 39:38.360
Not as beautiful as you.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.640
This is a public area.

39:39.720 --> 39:41.200
Watch your language.

39:41.280 --> 39:42.600
My innocence has long gone

39:42.680 --> 39:44.360
because of you.

39:45.720 --> 39:47.040
Don't settle on my account.

39:47.120 --> 39:48.720
Many local women are interested in you.

39:48.800 --> 39:49.880
Why don't you consider them?

39:49.960 --> 39:51.040
Are you jealous?

39:51.720 --> 39:52.640
You wish!

39:52.720 --> 39:54.360
I won't fight other women over a man.

39:54.440 --> 39:55.920
Then tell me

39:57.000 --> 39:58.240
why you cried earlier.

41:00.280 --> 41:02.800
This armband
doesn't make you the boss here.

41:03.640 --> 41:04.680
I still won't allow that.

41:04.760 --> 41:06.960
If we see anyone kissing later,
don't stop me.

41:07.040 --> 41:08.280
I couldn't care less about you.

41:08.360 --> 41:09.200
Gosh.

41:12.520 --> 41:13.640
Hey, look at this.

41:13.720 --> 41:14.800
What is this flower?

41:14.880 --> 41:16.000
Is it a lotus?

41:16.080 --> 41:17.120
Hey, over here.

41:17.200 --> 41:18.520
Look at this.

41:18.600 --> 41:19.440
This…

43:41.520 --> 43:48.160
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
